; BLACKSTONE BELL, the core system - A SHELL AT SP1 (design 1.1): a name row and nothing else, so the
; frame loads and the character sheet titles the box. SP2 (design section 2) fills it: Bringer of Glory
; (the Exalt reaction, action_exalt), Fell the Mighty (the Protocol, action_fell_the_mighty, with
; buff_doomed), and the Efficient pair (action_efficient_refund + the shared passive_efficient_used).
; The cp_ prefix is load-bearing (kit.gd:66). SP3: two glyph families (Bringer of Glory / Exalt, Fell
; the Mighty / DOOMED - memory icon-glyph-families).
[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_kit")
is_trait = true
